## JSON

Applicable for any json: technical file multiline string in code and examples in documentation.

For any object property or list element use separate line. Never Write object in one line.
Example:

```json
{
  "object_key": {
    "number_key": 1,
    "string_key": "string_value"
  },
  "list_key": [
    "element1",
    "element2"
  ]
}
```
